@astrogilda thanks for both rows. One correction to my own posting, for the receipt-signature row: `jcs.py` is not shared with your repository.

The verifier's docstring says "The only code shared with this repository is jcs.py", meaning argentum-core. I carried that wording into #352, where "this repository" reads as yours. The file is argentum-core's own `jcs.py` (blob `41457d1` at `80579e5`), and no file in your tree at `v0.36.3` has that blob.

The label stays directed, and the rest of what the row takes from my posting is right.
